Cell["\<\
A second observer separates what the first one identifies: on the events both \
observers chart, the joined radar coordinates of the sprinkling have more \
cells than the coordinates of the first observer.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"37e29a4e-902b-4b7d-9e94-3565d65b81f1"],

